  },
  "description": "How ecomdemo-app behaves when catalog-service fails: the circuit breaker, retry and bulkhead around every catalog call (Phase 22). Provisioned from docker/grafana/dashboards/ecomdemo-resilience.json - edits made in this UI are overwritten on reload.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "catalog-service circuit",
      "description": "The breaker's state NOW: CLOSED (calls flow), OPEN (every call refused at once for 10 s, no network), HALF_OPEN (three trial calls decide). lastNotNull is right here because the query is a gauge of the current state - unlike a rate(), whose last point is one noisy sample (the Phase 19 overview defect).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CLOSED",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "HALF_OPEN",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "OPEN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\", state=\"open\"}) * 2 + max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\", state=\"half_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "state",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failure rate (last 10 calls)",
      "description": "Share of the last 10 recorded calls that failed (I/O error, timeout, 5xx). At 50% the breaker opens. -1 means fewer than 5 calls have been made - too few to judge, so the breaker will not open on them.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "-1": {
                  "text": "too few calls",
                  "color": "text",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 25
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_failure_rate{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"})",
          "legendFormat": "failure rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Refused by the open circuit (range)",
      "description": "Calls that never left this service because the breaker was open. Each is a request that failed in microseconds instead of waiting on a timeout - and a request catalog-service did not have to survive while it recovered.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_not_permitted_calls_total{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "refused",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "503s served (range)",
      "description": "What the shopper saw: responses that were a clear 503 with Retry-After, instead of a 500 or a request that hung. increase() over $__range follows the time picker.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"$application\", status=\"503\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "503s",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Circuit state over time",
      "description": "The failure demo in one picture: CLOSED, then OPEN when catalog-service stops, HALF_OPEN every 10 s while it is still down (and straight back to OPEN), then CLOSED once it answers again.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CLOSED",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "HALF_OPEN",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "OPEN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\", state=\"open\"}) * 2 + max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\", state=\"half_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "catalog",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Calls to catalog-service by outcome",
      "description": "Every call the breaker saw, by outcome. successful and failed are what it judges on. ignored = refused by our own BULKHEAD (never reached catalog-service, so it counts for neither). not_permitted = refused by the OPEN breaker.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_calls_seconds_count{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_not_permitted_calls_total{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "not_permitted",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Retries",
      "description": "Reads only - writes are never retried. successful_with_retry is a blip the shopper never saw. failed_with_retry is both attempts failing: the case the breaker exists to cut short. failed_without_retry is mostly refusals by the OPEN breaker, which are deliberately never retried - retrying them is the storm the breaker exists to stop.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(resilience4j_retry_calls_total{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bulkhead: catalog calls in flight",
      "description": "How many of the 20 permitted concurrent calls are in use. Reaching the limit line means catalog-service is slow enough that callers are queueing on it - and the bulkhead is what stops them taking every request thread in the service.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "limit"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_bulkhead_max_allowed_concurrent_calls{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"}) - max(resilience4j_bulkhead_available_concurrent_calls{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"})",
          "legendFormat": "in flight",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_bulkhead_max_allowed_concurrent_calls{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Catalog call latency (mean)",
      "description": "Mean duration of a call, by outcome. Failed calls near 1 s are READ TIMEOUTS (a hung catalog-service); failed calls near zero are refusals (a stopped one). The difference is why a timeout is the first layer, not the last.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ecomdemo-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_calls_seconds_sum{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\", kind=~\"successful|failed\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (kind) (rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_calls_seconds_count{application=\"$application\", name=\"catalog\", kind=~\"successful|failed\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
